#: 8db0dfb213724c6998b593e813138a6d ac8c758d899b4a25bef584d44166836f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has FrSky telemetry drivers to natively output autopilot "
"information through the serial ports. It comes in two flavors:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 具有 FrSky 数传驱动，可通过串口原生输出飞控信息。它有两种形式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-protocol-info.rst:18
#: 107326c0849c46dd81a7933ce13d22b3 496ee2389a6e44da8012b8291f22275a
#: 6a4e44e928c44b3991e83fd6ccbf0276 6b28c41142eb4833982d3a7d5ad826bf
#: 76840038e337476d9291834eaec13313 cc703c334d344222952ea1d4e35a3766
msgid ""
":ref:`Repurposed FrSky telemetry <common-frsky-repurposed>` (D and "
"SmartPort), which reuses FrSky data IDs to transmit basic flight control "
"information to the RC transmitter (e.g. T2 temperature message reused to "
"transmit the number of GPS satellites and GPS status); and"
msgstr ""
":ref:`复用 FrSky 数传 <common-frsky-repurposed>` （D 和 SmartPort），复用 FrSky 数据 ID "
"将基本飞行控制信息传输到遥控器（例如，T2 温度消息被复用来传输 GPS 卫星数量和 GPS 状态）；以及"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-protocol-info.rst:20
#: 156be31cc07246a0b682296c1e580305 6a5859bbba744ac388bb56f032a83ca9
#: 9dd42c0eccbd43aeacd396f73eb363fe a083bbf7d5014562ad2491ce42dd134a
#: bd74a9b565484b1d81bf62a7269b3973 e5e06338d1194ce2b3ca48221c31b864
msgid ""
":ref:`Passthrough telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` (SmartPort), which "
"leverages the new passthrough FrSky data IDs to send an extensive amount of "
"autopilot specific information to the RC transmitter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`直通数传 <common-frsky-passthrough>` （SmartPort），利用新的直通 FrSky 数据 ID "
"向遥控器发送大量 ArduPilot 特有信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-protocol-info.rst:22
