msgid ""
"FrSky telemetry is also possible through the use of a :ref:`MAVLink to FrSky"
" converter <common-frsky-mavlink>`."
msgstr "FrSky 数传也可通过 :ref:`MAVLink 转 FrSky 转换器 <common-frsky-mavlink>` 实现。"

